sensitive to this human electromagnetic field, and they could be 
changed from  satellites of war and intrusion into satellites 
making a true world democracy possible.  The World Management 
Committee will inform people by broadcasting the "specific 
computer-derived problem-solution proposals" to them.  After an 
adequate time period, a referendum will be taken on how the 
people feel about the proposal.  When a 75% majority is 
"attained, the professional-management world committee will be 
authorized to put the proposition into the world-around 
industrial production and service" (342). Fuller writes, 

